OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of occasionally heavy
OL,6,Frain in the morning then dry and
OL,7,Fbright for a time before further
OL,8,Fshowers return later in the afternoon.
OL,9,FFresh to strong southerly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be a mostly cloudy
OL,12,Fevening with some showers, perhaps
OL,13,Fheavy. Then turning drier overnight
OL,14,Fwith some clear intervals.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,17,Fsome sunny intervals. A mainly dry
OL,18,Fmorning then a few heavy showers
OL,19,Fdeveloping in the afternoon. Fresh to
OL,20,Fstrong southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
