OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBright
OL,6,Fbut showery on Tuesday with strong
OL,7,Fwinds. Dry with some sunshine on
OL,8,FWednesday. Rain spreading from west on
OL,9,FThursday.
